# digital low pass filter
# assume x_i is integer
# assume coeff_i is 8 bit fractional number
--- Netlist
y_o --> delay(1) --> y_dly
lambda n: 256 --> full_num
full_num, coeff_i --> sub --> mul_1_b
x_i, mul_1_b --> mul --> integer_divide(256) --> mul_1_y_int
y_dly, coeff_i --> mul --> integer_divide(256) --> mul_2_y_int
mul_1_y_int, mul_2_y_int --> add --> y_o
--- Pin
in: x_i, coeff_i
out: y_o
